MODIFICATIONS

The following modifications were made to the original AionUi / AionCore
codebase for this project:

  * Electron desktop shell removed; pure web deployment (single Rust binary
    serving the React SPA via rust-embed).
  * Added `roseui-wiki` crate: Markdown knowledge base with SQLite FTS5,
    bidirectional links, and Agent-via-MCP read/write.
  * Added `legacy_handoff` module: Electron-era database migration with
    dry-run and rollback.
  * Local identity mode (`--local`) authentication bypass fixed for embedded
    single-binary operation.
  * China-market and vertical-industry optimizations (in progress).

Modified files should carry a "Modified by DoDidDoneUi 团队 on <date>" header
note in addition to the original copyright line.

