VENDORED COMPONENT: Rupoo Agent Engine (MIT License)

This project vendors a copy of the Rupoo agent engine inside
`upstream-AionCore/extern/rupoo` (a subtree copy of
https://github.com/Steventsang18/rupoo, crate `rupoo`, version 0.6.3). It is
included as a local path dependency so the build has no external or
machine-specific path requirements. The vendored copy drops the standalone TUI
REPL dependencies (ratatui/crossterm/etc.) so the library embeds cleanly into
the host dependency tree.

